钠溶液反应生成气体的化合物的结构简式为_______、_______", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 834631, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 22}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "2；本题考查了阿伏加德罗定律的知识点。根据阿伏加德罗定律,标准状况下，该混合气体的物质的量为1mol,1 mol SO<sub>2</sub>,、CO<sub>2</sub>均含有2mol氧原子。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 834632, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "2019", "starCount": 0, "title": "标准状况下,22.4LSO<sub>2</sub>和CO<sub>2</sub>混合气体中含有的氧原子数为_______N<sub>A</sub> (N<sub>A</sub>为阿伏加德罗常数)", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 834632, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 23}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "2,2,4-三甲基戊烷；本题考查了有机化合物的命名的知识点。选定分子中最长的碳链为主链,按其碳原子数称作“某烷”;其次选主链中离支链最近的一端为起点,给主链上的各个碳原子编号定位;最后用阿拉伯数字标明支链的位置进行命名。主链有5个碳原子,三个甲基距两边不相等,因此该有机物可命名为2,2,4-三甲基戊烷", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 834633, "exerType": "历年试题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "2019", "starCount": 0, "title": "汽油中含有抗爆性能较好的异辛烷,其结构简式为<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2020TKZT/J15.png' />,按照系统命名规则,其名称为_______", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 834633, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 24}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 834634, "exerType": "历年试题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">溴化锰；1</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">【考情点拨】本题考查了氧化还原反应及其计算的知识点。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">【应试指导】该反应方程式配平后为</span><img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/Upload/image/20200324/6372066808907125556058770.jpg\" title=\"clip_image002.jpg\"/><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">被还原为MnBr<sub>2</sub>,氧化剂为kMnO<sub>4</sub>,根据系数比,生成2. 5mol Br<sub>2</sub>需消耗氧化剂KMnO<sub>4</sub> 1mol</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br/></p>", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "2019", "starCount": 0, "title": "高锰酸钾溶液与氢溴酸可以发生如下反应:KMnO<sub>4</sub>+HBr→Br<sub>2</sub>+KBr+MnBr<sub>2</sub>+H<sub>2</sub>O(未配平),此反应的还原产物的名称为_______,若反应中有2.5 mol Br<sub>2</sub>生成,消耗的氧化剂的物质的量为_______mol", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 834634, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 25}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 834635, "exerType": "历年试题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "<p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"></span><img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/Upload/image/20200324/6372066841179181105462743.jpg\" title=\"clip_image002.jpg\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">【考情点拨】本题考查了常见短周期元素的知识点。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">【应试指导】根据题意可以推出X为H,Y为O,Z为Na,即Na与H<sub>2</sub>O反应;Y与Z的1:1化合物为过氧化钠(Na<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub>)。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br/></p>", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "2019", "starCount": 0, "title": "元素X、Y和Z均属于短周期元素,其原子序数依次增大且原子序数之和为20，Y<sup>2-</sup>和Z<sup>+</sup>的电子层结构均与氖的相同。Z与化合物X<sub>2</sub>Y反应的化学方程式为_______,Y与Z形成的1:1化合物的电子式为_______", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 834635, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 26}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "由题知t<sub>1</sub>=1s时,C车开始启动,此时A车的行驶距离为<img src=http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2020TKZT/J31.png />则此时A、C车之间的距离为\r\ns=s<sub>1</sub>+2L+2l=1+2×3+2×0.5=8(m)\r\n", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 834636, "exerType": "历年试题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 11, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 11, "source": "2019", "starCount": 0, "title": "(11分)如图,在十字路有三辆长均为L=3m的小汽车A、B、C在等待放行的绿灯,两车之内间的距离均为l=0.5m。绿灯亮后,A车开始启动,经过=t0.5s后,B车开始启动,又经过同样的时间,C车开始启动。若三辆车的运动均可视为匀加速运动,加速度的大小均为a=2m/s<sup>2</sup>,求:当C车启动时,A、C两车之间的距离s。<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2020TKZT/J16.png' />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 834636, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 27}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 834637, "exerType": "历年试题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">设带电粒子距下面导体板的距离为d,导体板不带电时粒子做平抛运动,则</span></p><p><img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/Upload/image/20200324/6372066846015883258383908.jpg\" title=\"clip_image002.jpg\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">导体板之间带电时可得</span></p><p><img src=\"http://ppt.beegoedu.com/Upload/image/20200324/6372066846027601257883141.jpg\" title=\"clip_image004.jpg\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">由受力分析可得</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">mg-Eq=ma</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">联立上式可得E=5mg/9q</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br/></p>", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 12, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 12, "source": "2019", "starCount": 0, "title": "(12分)如图,一带正电的粒子以水平速度v0射入长为l、水平放置的两平行导体板之间,当导体板不带电时,带电粒子落在B板上距射入端2l/3处。现使A、B两导体板带上等量异号的电荷,则在同一位置以同样速度射人的带电粒子恰好可以到达B板的边缘,求此时两板间电场强度的大小。已知两次射入的带电粒子的质量均为m,电荷量均为q,重力加速度为g(不计空气阻力)<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2020TKZT/J17.png' />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 834637, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 28}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "设标准情况下112L氨气的物质的量为x,则<img src=http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/2020TKZT/J32.png />由题知 NaCIO为2mol,根据系数比,NH<sub>3</sub>过量,2 mol NaCIO只能生成2mol N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>；N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>的相对分子质量为32g/mol,设能制得肼的质量为y,则y=2mol×32g/mol=64g；故最多能制得肼64g", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 0, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 834638, "exerType": "历年试题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 0, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2019年成考高升本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 10, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 10, "source": "2019", "starCount": 0, "title": "(10分)将氨气通过NaClO碱性溶液可以制N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub> (肼)反应的化学方程式如下:NaClO+2NH<sub>3</sub> =NaCl+H<sub>2</sub>O+N<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>;现将112L氨气(标况)通入1L2mol/L NaCIO的碱性溶液,最多能制得肼多少克?", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 834638, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 29}], "SimExamStore": {"ExerNum": 29, "CourseId": "H011701", "ExamTime": 120, "ExerSortType": 1, "ScoringMethod": 1, "TotalScore": 150, "SimType": "历年真题", "ExamName": "2019年成考高升本物理化学真题"}, "simId": 7812}